<div style="background-color: #e8f5e8; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #4CAF50; margin: 20px 0;">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #2e7d32;">]]>🎉<![CDATA[ 恭喜！您的请假申请已获得批准。</p>
</div>
<div style="background-color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;">
<h3 style="color: #333; margin-top: 0;">申请详情：</h3>
<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; font-weight: bold; width: 30%;">申请编号：</td>
<td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;">${number}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; font-weight: bold;">请假理由：</td>
<td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;">${short_description}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; font-weight: bold;">请假日期：</td>
<td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;">${leave_date_start} 至 ${leave_date_end}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; font-weight: bold;">请假时间：</td>
<td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;">${leave_time_start} - ${leave_time_end}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: bold;">审批状态：</td>
<td style="padding: 8px 0;"><span style="color: #4caf50; font-weight: bold;">${approval}</span></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div style="background-color: #fff3cd; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; margin: 20px 0;">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px;"><strong>]]>📋<![CDATA[ 温馨提示：</strong><br>&bull; 请确保按照公司规定安排好工作交接<br>&bull; 如有紧急情况，请及时联系团队成员<br>&bull; 假期结束后请按时返回工作岗位</p>
</div>
<div style="background-color: #e3f2fd; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #2196F3; margin: 20px 0;">
